%9Setting:%9

    backup_keep (integer; default: 7)

%9Description:%9

    How many automatic backups stay in backup_dir. After each backup
    that worked, the newest backup_keep files named
    erssi-auto-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.tar.gz are kept and older ones of that
    name removed. Files of any other name are never removed, nor links:
    put a backup you want to keep under another name. 0 keeps them all.

%9Examples:%9

    /SET backup_keep 7
    /SET backup_keep 0

%9See also:%9 BACKUP, BACKUP_AUTO, BACKUP_DIR
